sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Viewer
  participant M as main.js
  participant F as fate.js
  participant D as drand API
  participant S as sim.js
  participant R as Renderer
  V->>M: open page
  M->>M: prng and sim selfTest
  M->>F: ensureFates day 18 to today
  F->>D: GET public round for each day
  D-->>F: randomness hex or 404 if future
  F->>F: cache in memory and localStorage
  M->>S: evaluate simNow
  S->>S: worldClock gives day and tod
  S->>F: fateOf day
  F-->>S: real hex or pseudo hex flagged
  S->>S: dayKind buildPlan positionAt needsAt
  S-->>M: npcs lots garden animals events
  M->>R: draw poses and crossfade clips
  R-->>V: frame at wall clock time
